<title>USA: Kollmorgen net higher.</title>
<headline>Kollmorgen net higher.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>KOLLMORGEN CORPORATION and SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		(Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			For the Three Months  For the Twelve Months</p>
<p>			     ended December 31,  ended December 31,</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales (A)		  $60,766 $61,684 $230,424 $228,655</p>
<p> Cost of sales		   40,179  41,806  152,928  152,614</p>
<p> Gross profit		    20,587  19,878   77,496   76,041</p>
