<p>Research and development   expense			   3,119   3,525   12,143   13,178</p>
<p>Income before interest,</p>
<p>minority interest, and taxes</p>
<p>					4,407   3,062   13,435   11,016</p>
<p> Interest and other expenses  1,280     416    5,045    3,859</p>
<p> Minority interest		 (96)	--    (514)	 --</p>
<p> Income before income taxes   3,223   2,646    8,904    7,157</p>
<p> Tax provision			 --	--	 --	 --</p>
<p> Net Income			 3,223   2,646    8,904    7,157</p>
<p> Earnings per common shr (B)  0.32  (0.03)     0.86     0.26</p>
<p>(A)  Excluding businesses previously sold, revenues (in thousands) were $58,153 for the fourth quarter of 1995 and $229,492 and $211,305 for the twelve months ended December 31, 1996 and 1995, respectively.</p>
<p>(B)  Earnings per share figures for the three and twelve months ended December 31, 1995, include a charge of $2.3 million, or $0.24 per share, representing the 10% premium paid on the redemption of the Series D Convertible Preferred Stock in February 1996.</p>
